--- !u!114 &1296337882
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1296337880}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#E7C77A><b>CASE 07 \u2014 THE ROYAL SAPPHIRE</b></color>\r\n<color=#8FA9BE>STATUS:
    ACTIVE INVESTIGATION</color>\r\n\r\nThe Royal Sapphire, registry code RS-01,
    has disappeared from its secured display inside the National History Museum.\r\n\r\nThe
    display system recorded no forced entry or physical damage. During the closing
    period, several authorized maintenance, security, collection, and dispatch activities
    occurred within the same time window. The available records contain contradictions,
    incomplete actions, and entries that may not match what physically happened.\r\n\r\n\r\n<color=#E7C77A><b>PRIMARY
    OBJECTIVE</b></color>\r\n\r\nDetermine:\r\n\r\n1. WHO removed the original Royal
    Sapphire.\r\n2. WHERE the original Royal Sapphire is currently hidden.\r\n\r\nSubmit
    both conclusions through the Detective Board before the investigation timer expires.\r\n\r\n\r\n<color=#E7C77A><b>KNOWN
    CONDITIONS</b></color>\r\n\r\n\u2022 The museum closed to the public at 20:00.\r\n\u2022
    The display shows no evidence of forced entry.\r\n\u2022 Multiple staff credentials
    were used during the incident window.\r\n\u2022 Maintenance, security, replica
    handling, and dispatch operations overlapped.\r\n\u2022 Several registered objects
    have similar or identical weights.\r\n\u2022 A digital record does not always
    confirm that a physical action occurred.\r\n\r\n\r\n<color=#E7C77A><b>POSSIBLE
    HIDING LOCATIONS</b></color>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Archive Shelf A-17\r\n\u2022 Replica
    Cabinet C-02\r\n\u2022 Technician Tool Case M-04\r\n\u2022 Outgoing Restoration
    Crate C-07\r\n\r\n\r\n<color=#E7C77A><b>INVESTIGATION PROTOCOL</b></color>\r\n\r\n\u2022
    Examine all available evidence documents.\r\n\u2022 Compare timestamps, credential
    IDs, physical access, and system authority.\r\n\u2022 Separate confirmed physical
    events from database entries and automated logs.\r\n\u2022 Do not identify an
    object using weight alone.\r\n\u2022 Character access indicates opportunity,
    not guilt.\r\n\u2022 Suspect statements may contain omissions, accusations, or
    misleading claims.\r\n\u2022 The team receives only one final submission.\r\n\r\n<color=#8FA9BE>Cross-reference
    the evidence. No single document reveals the complete sequence.</color>"
