  m_text: "EVIDENCE CONTENT PREVIEW\r\n\r\nThis is placeholder content for the reusable
    evidence popup. The final document will be inserted after the storyline and evidence
    structure have been approved.\r\n\r\n20:02 \u2014 Example system event recorded.\r\n20:05
    \u2014 Example maintenance status updated.\r\n20:08 \u2014 Example inspection
    process started.\r\n20:12 \u2014 Example archive accessed.\r\n20:17 \u2014 Example
    record modified.\r\n20:20 \u2014 Example security event registered.\r\n20:22
    \u2014 Example document saved.\r\n20:25 \u2014 Example activity detected.\r\n20:28
    \u2014 Example system status restored.\r\n20:30 \u2014 Example session closed.\r\n\r\nADDITIONAL
    NOTES\r\n\r\nThe evidence popup must support documents that are longer than the
    visible reading area.\r\n\r\nPlayers will use the mouse wheel or vertical scrollbar
    to read the remaining information.\r\n\r\nThis content is temporary. The reusable
    popup controller will replace this text when an evidence hotspot is clicked.\r\n\r\nEND
    OF PLACEHOLDER DOCUMENT"
