--- !u!114 &2006140144
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2006140142}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 439e80f030e471745af79d4ec367ac80, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HotspotController
  evidenceLocation: "SECURITY OFFICE \u2014 SECURITY RECORDS CONSOLE"
  evidenceLocationIndonesian: "KANTOR KEAMANAN \u2014 KONSOL CATATAN KEAMANAN"
  document1:
    evidenceID: E07_DOOR_PATROL_RECORDS
    tabName: DOOR & PATROL RECORDS
    evidenceTitle: DOOR CONTROL & PATROL RECORDS
    evidenceType: SECURITY LOG
    evidenceBody: "DATE: 14 AUGUST\r\n\r\nEAST SERVICE PASSAGE\r\n19:50:13 DOOR OPENED
      \u2014 SEC-01\r\n19:50:22 HOLD-OPEN MODE ENABLED \u2014 SEC-01\r\n        SCHEDULED
      RELEASE: 20:30\r\n20:30:00 HOLD-OPEN MODE RELEASED\r\n\r\nSYSTEM NOTE:\r\nIndividual
      badge events are not generated while Hold-Open Mode is active.\r\n\r\nDANIEL
      PATROL CHECKPOINTS\r\n19:37 SECURITY OFFICE \u2014 SEC-01\r\n19:41 MUSEUM ENTRANCE
      \u2014 SEC-01\r\n19:44 MUSEUM ENTRANCE EXIT \u2014 SEC-01\r\n19:48 STAFF CORRIDOR
      \u2014 SEC-01\r\n20:03 WEST PUBLIC CORRIDOR \u2014 SEC-01\r\n20:17 SECURITY
      OFFICE RETURN \u2014 SEC-01\r\n\r\nINCIDENT NOTE:\r\nNo approved Hold-Open
      request is attached to the closing patrol."
    tabNameIndonesian: PINTU & PATROLI
    evidenceTitleIndonesian: CATATAN KONTROL PINTU & PATROLI
    evidenceTypeIndonesian: CATATAN KEAMANAN
    evidenceBodyIndonesian: "CATATAN KONTROL PINTU & PATROLI\r\n\r\nTANGGAL: 14 AGUSTUS\r\n\r\n\r\nLORONG
      SERVIS TIMUR\r\n\r\n19:50:13 PINTU DIBUKA \u2014 SEC-01\r\n\r\n19:50:22 MODE
      TAHAN-TERBUKA DIAKTIFKAN \u2014 SEC-01\r\n           JADWAL PENONAKTIFAN: 20:30\r\n\r\n20:30:00
      MODE TAHAN-TERBUKA DINONAKTIFKAN\r\n\r\n\r\nCATATAN SISTEM:\r\n\r\nAktivitas
      kartu akses individual tidak dibuat saat Mode Tahan-Terbuka aktif.\r\n\r\n\r\nCHECKPOINT
      PATROLI DANIEL\r\n\r\n19:37 KANTOR KEAMANAN \u2014 SEC-01\r\n\r\n19:41 PINTU
      MASUK MUSEUM \u2014 SEC-01\r\n\r\n19:44 KELUAR DARI PINTU MASUK MUSEUM \u2014
      SEC-01\r\n\r\n19:48 KORIDOR STAF \u2014 SEC-01\r\n\r\n20:03 KORIDOR PUBLIK
      BARAT \u2014 SEC-01\r\n\r\n20:17 KEMBALI KE KANTOR KEAMANAN \u2014 SEC-01\r\n\r\n\r\nCATATAN
      INSIDEN:\r\n\r\nTidak ada permintaan Mode Tahan-Terbuka yang disetujui dan
      dilampirkan pada patroli penutupan."
  document2:
    evidenceID: E08_INTERVIEW_ARCHIVE
    tabName: INTERVIEW ARCHIVE
    evidenceTitle: INTERVIEW ARCHIVE
    evidenceType: INTERVIEW TRANSCRIPTS
    evidenceBody: "[DANIEL \u2014 SECURITY GUARD]\r\n\u201CI followed the approved
      patrol route and did not change any door setting. Lucas was moving equipment
      through the service area. If the East Service Passage was left open, he is
      the person you should question.\u201D\r\n\r\n[OLIVIA \u2014 CURATOR]\r\n\u201CI
      completed the Backup Replica Check and returned ER-12 before 19:55. Ethan had
      been searching the replica records before the incident. If a collection entry
      was altered or an object was moved through Staff Office, ask him.\u201D\r\n\r\n[ETHAN
      \u2014 ADMINISTRATIVE STAFF]\r\n\u201CI remained at my workstation from 20:12
      until after 20:28. The activity log should prove I was typing and saving the
      monthly report. Olivia was responsible for the replicas and had curator access
      to the inner holder, not me.\u201D\r\n\r\n[LUCAS \u2014 TECHNICIAN]\r\n\u201CThe
      camera restarted automatically after a calibration error. I requested more
      calibration time, but I did not authorize the security extension or change
      the passage door. Daniel controlled the security system and was responsible
      for that patrol.\u201D\r\n\r\n[GRACE \u2014 MUSEUM DIRECTOR]\r\n\u201CLucas
      requested the extended maintenance window after his calibration failed. The
      system processed the extension for his work; I did not personally override
      the procedure. His tools and movements should be investigated.\u201D\r\n\r\nINTERVIEW
      NOTE:\r\nStatements were collected separately. No suspect had access to another
      suspect\u2019s transcript."
    tabNameIndonesian: ARSIP WAWANCARA
    evidenceTitleIndonesian: 'ARSIP WAWANCARA '
    evidenceTypeIndonesian: TRANSKRIP WAWANCARA
    evidenceBodyIndonesian: "[DANIEL \u2014 PETUGAS KEAMANAN]\r\n\r\n\u201CSaya mengikuti
      rute patroli yang telah disetujui dan tidak mengubah pengaturan pintu apa pun.
      Lucas memindahkan peralatan melalui area servis. Jika Lorong Servis Timur dibiarkan
      terbuka, dialah yang seharusnya kalian periksa.\u201D\r\n\r\n\r\n[OLIVIA \u2014
      KURATOR]\r\n\r\n\u201CSaya menyelesaikan Pemeriksaan Replika Cadangan dan mengembalikan
      ER-12 sebelum pukul 19:55. Ethan telah mencari informasi mengenai replika sebelum
      insiden terjadi. Jika ada entri koleksi yang diubah atau benda yang dipindahkan
      melalui Kantor Staf, tanyakan kepadanya.\u201D\r\n\r\n\r\n[ETHAN \u2014 STAF
      ADMINISTRASI]\r\n\r\n\u201CSaya tetap berada di workstation sejak pukul 20:12
      hingga setelah pukul 20:28. Log aktivitas seharusnya membuktikan bahwa saya
      mengetik dan menyimpan laporan bulanan. Olivia bertanggung jawab atas replika
      dan memiliki akses kurator ke dudukan dalam, bukan saya.\u201D\r\n\r\n\r\n[LUCAS
      \u2014 TEKNISI]\r\n\r\n\u201CKamera melakukan restart secara otomatis setelah
      terjadi kesalahan kalibrasi. Saya memang meminta tambahan waktu kalibrasi,
      tetapi saya tidak mengesahkan perpanjangan sistem keamanan ataupun mengubah
      pengaturan pintu lorong. Daniel mengendalikan sistem keamanan dan bertanggung
      jawab atas patroli tersebut.\u201D\r\n\r\n\r\n[GRACE \u2014 DIREKTUR MUSEUM]\r\n\r\n\u201CLucas
      meminta agar periode pemeliharaan diperpanjang setelah kalibrasinya gagal.
      Sistem memproses perpanjangan tersebut untuk pekerjaannya; saya tidak mengesampingkan
      prosedur secara pribadi. Peralatan dan pergerakannya seharusnya diperiksa.\u201D\r\n\r\n\r\nCATATAN
      WAWANCARA:\r\n\r\nPernyataan dikumpulkan secara terpisah. Tidak ada tersangka
      yang memiliki akses terhadap transkrip tersangka lainnya."
  hotspotName: SECURITY RECORDS CONSOLE
  hotspotContentSummary: 2 DOCUMENTS
  hotspotNameIndonesian: CATATAN KEAMANAN
  hotspotContentSummaryIndonesian: 2 DOKUMEN
  hotspotNameText: {fileID: 479182968}
  hotspotCountText: {fileID: 1907005276}
  presentationStyle: 2
  popupController: {fileID: 869402488}
